---
description: Confirm tests fail for the intended reason before implementation
alwaysApply: true
---

Before implementing a fix or behavior change, write and run the relevant test against the existing code.
Confirm it fails for the intended behavioral reason, not a setup, syntax, or unrelated error.
Only then implement the change and rerun the test to confirm it passes.
Do not substitute a manual reproduction or a retrospective red run for this sequence.
